			<div class="content" id="post-content-3740762">
									

<p>Very well written scip; I think the transition from document to &quot;we're going to find our daughter&quot; is particularly well done, so kudos on that.</p>
<p>I was actually a bit disappointed because the premise of &quot;memetic conspiracy which cannot be extracted from the host&quot; can be taken in much, <em>much</em> more interesting places. The twist is fairly easy to see coming, so the idea can be played with in other ways. Personally I would go with records of the Foundation trying desperately to cover up mass protests, vigils, and large-scale consequences of people buying into the conspiracy, or else shed some doubt on the veracity of Deborah's identity.</p>

